      "created_at": "2013-04-29T20:03:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know this sounds like a dumb question to many, but i've got to ask someone - can a hero that has been incapacitated be healed? &nbsp;Once they no longer have hit points, are they even considered targets? &nbsp;</p>",
